    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the world of <i>Tyto</i>\u00a0- a visually stunning platformer featuring hand-painted artwork and a breathtaking soundtrack, composed by the developer himself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.poster.avif?t=1753943295\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.webm?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.mp4?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Yali</strong>, a young owlet lost in a vast forest ruled by fearsome vultures. Rescued and raised by mice, he becomes part of their rebellion, bringing a unique advantage - the power of flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.poster.avif?t=1753943295\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.webm?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.mp4?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through the treetops, uncover hidden secrets, and embark on a journey to reunite with your family while fighting to free the forest from vulture tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.poster.avif?t=1753943295\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.webm?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.mp4?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the world of <i>Tyto</i>\u00a0- a visually stunning platformer featuring hand-painted artwork and a breathtaking soundtrack, composed by the developer himself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.poster.avif?t=1753943295\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.webm?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/dd55a279479e44babb6eb0ecd45837fe.mp4?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Yali</strong>, a young owlet lost in a vast forest ruled by fearsome vultures. Rescued and raised by mice, he becomes part of their rebellion, bringing a unique advantage - the power of flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.poster.avif?t=1753943295\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.webm?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/7583bdff8b5792a9b9de0c8602050e74.mp4?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through the treetops, uncover hidden secrets, and embark on a journey to reunite with your family while fighting to free the forest from vulture tyranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.poster.avif?t=1753943295\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.webm?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/409473e6d4135206e46257351a972558.mp4?t=1753943295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
